n.json --resume`\n53\tor the same command with tasks/evidence-index.json. These are observations, not new\n54\twork. Do not delete state/launch evidence to bypass a guard.\n55\t\n56\tFrozen accepted input/verifiers, candidate and candidate-before-continuation remain\n57\tunder .runtime/tasks/runtime-run-report-1; all meaningful source/inputs/bundles/raw\n58\tresults are preserved in Git. Final SQLite backup: evidence/v0.1/runtime.sqlite.gz.\n59\tBefore any future execution verify old writers stopped, subscriptions still use\n60\tthe qualified route and exact selected binaries match. Follow docs/runbook.md.\n61\tNo project-wide time/token budget was invented; individual calls are bounded.\n62\t\n63\tAfter final release checks are complete, this mandate ends. Further improvements\n64\tneed a concrete accepted task; do not start an open-ended optimization loop.\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7ea7a62-668d-4328-ab22-c88d5a0db694","uuid":"ccdfc895-9a5a-4b34-854d-9eed5302cf00","timestamp":"2026-09-19T12:46:25.457Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/elinhaggstrom/Nortropic Runtime/docs/plan.md","content":"# Living plan — Runtime v0.1\n\n## Current step: final continuity audit and release documentation\n\nRESULTAT: Both useful accepted tasks completed and integrated through Runtime.\nActual report Codex→Claude→Codex, external tests, separate fresh review and automatic\nprotected PR12 merge succeeded. Restart of both tasks returned identical completed\nstates with no new model attempts/publications. Runtime v0.1 awaits the final\nfresh-session audit and separately reviewed documentation integration.\n\nARBETSYTA: /Users/elinhaggstrom/Nortropic Runtime, Nortropic/nortropic-runtime.\nCurrent branch work/runtime-v01-evidence, based on integrated main98b92a7 (PR12).\nCompleted evidence commits were cherry-picked from preserved backup branch\nwork/report-continuation, without rewriting that branch. Origin public by owner\nD006; require