{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VE8gA9sokVXBw5UR4pEQH9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Real report task completed through Codex → Claude → Codex\n2\t\n3\tSame native workflow runtime-run-report-1, original accepted task from tasks/run-report.json.\n4\tAttempt1 was deliberately interrupted when a host-verifier boundary defect was\n5\tfound; D014 records its separately reviewed correction. Attempt2 implemented the\n6\tCodex phase and waited for the unavailable Claude subscription. Owner later restored\n7\taccess. D019 qualifies the existing Max route; D020 records an explicitly reviewed\n8\tbase/full-verifier continuation. Neither outcome, source scope, prompts nor limits\n9\tchanged. The old workspace and exact source snapshots remain available.\n10\t\n11\tRuntime then invoked actual Claude attempt3 (147.813s), retained its implementation,\n12\tpassed33 host observations including28 candidate tests, and automatically invoked\n13\tactual Codex attempt4 on the same workspace. Codex found/fixed numeric overflow and\n14\tdecoder-depth CLI crashes, completed in131.891s, and passed33 host observations\n15\tincluding30 candidate tests. No parent edits or prompt relay occurred between them.\n16\tAll provider groups were removed before the next step.\n17\t\n18\tThe frozen final Git candidate is f86a85c27d7cb2567d3c600292f213fa45067b7a on accepted\n19\tbase531f097c85a42ac5afc86ace6bd8ee7f37fc5b8d. Fresh read-only reviewer\n20\t01a0b9ae-eec2-7603-9f1f-c5286fcfde12 approved in26.755s, with no blockers; it also\n21\tran23 parser tests and16 independent read-only CLI checks. This identity differs\n22\tfrom all four implementation sessions. Runtime published once through protected\n23\tPR12 https://github.com/Nortropic/nortropic-runtime/pull/12 and read back merge\n24\t98b92a72da2671c0a517f674f8b023667c070bcb, exact tree659eb238b4a4425c660d25dae15c2b1f42128615.\n25\t\n26\tcontinuity-proof.json records actual native activity order and