k (real-use-result.json), replacing manual hash calculation.\n28\t\n29\tA fresh native restart/--resume returned the exact same completed state in\n30\tobservations/572a19813b1148f48f9c4392a80608d5, with one attempt/publication and no\n31\tnew model launches. The original report task also still returned the exact prior\n32\twaiting_access/attempt2 state after this task; observation under\n33\t../../accepted-task/observations/cac8d5c56d044ea7a65f20180fee0252.\n34\tA planned mid-review history checkpoint reached an already stopped server because\n35\tthe workflow had completed; no retry or mutation followed that connection refusal.\n36\tThe full final native history is preserved instead.\n37\t\n38\tMeasured provider resources:\n39\t- Implementation174.901s: input217881, cached183296, output9431, reasoning797.\n40\t- Review34.25s: input54856, cached32384, output1421, reasoning648.\n41\t- Cache-write input0 for both. Counts are reported fields, not additive pricing\n42\t  quantities. Existing subscription; actual monetary cost is unknown.\n43\t\n44\tManual coordination: root authored/froze the task and host assertions, arranged\n45\tone bounded input review, then issued one submission command. Runtime performed\n46\tall phase transitions and integration without candidate edits, manual handoff,\n47\tmodel retries or additional owner decisions. Root preserved/reported evidence,\n48\tobserved restart and used the result. This is measured benefit for one specific\n49\taccepted task, not a general productivity/medical claim.\n50\t\n51\tLimits: the first report task remains incomplete awaiting actual Claude access.\n52\tThis second accepted task therefore does not yet prove two completed tasks or\n53\tCodex→Claude→Codex. General multiphase support and abrupt in-flight writer fencing\n54\tremain pending. Runtime v0.1 is not complete.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7ea7a62-668d-4328-ab22-c88d5a0db694","uuid":"34d5d284-6d4a-45fc-8ebe-96542fc9bbf6","timestamp"